# Editing respond-ui

- Tokens only from `respond-ui/foundations`. No new hex.
- Everything the primitive shows or does is a prop (copy, data, callbacks, children). No i18n, fetch, or store reads inside.
- Do not add `tx`, `txOptions`, `text`, or `preset` to primitives.
- Parent barrel: `export { Name } from "./Name/Name"` — never `from "./Name"`.
- App chrome and native/platform loaders stay in `app/components`. Do not add them here. Do not import route or navigation chrome. Always show pictures with the app image loader. Do not use React Native `Image`.

Canonical layout: @app/respond-ui/components/Text/Text.tsx @app/respond-ui/components/Button/Button.tsx
